#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: custom-related-products.php
msgid ""
"Related Products - Create Upsells, Cross-sells, and Product Recommendations "
"for WooCommerce"
msgstr ""
"Related Products - Create Upsells, Cross-sells, and Product Recommendations "
"for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: custom-related-products.php
msgid "https://wordpress.org/plugins/wt-woocommerce-related-products/"
msgstr "https://wordpress.org/plugins/wt-woocommerce-related-products/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: custom-related-products.php
msgid ""
"Displays custom related products based on category, tag, attribute or "
"product for your WooCommerce store."
msgstr ""
"Zeigt in Ihrem WooCommerce-Shop individuelle ähnliche Produkte basierend auf"
" Kategorie, Schlagwort, Attribut oder Produkt an."

#. Author of the plugin
#: custom-related-products.php
msgid "WebToffee"
msgstr "WebToffee"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: custom-related-products.php
msgid "https://www.webtoffee.com/"
msgstr "https://www.webtoffee.com/"

#. translators: %1$s HTML a tag opening, %2$s HTML a tag closing.
#: admin/class-custom-related-products-admin.php:117
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Please select %1$s Working mode %2$s as \"Custom related products\" to "
"reflect the selected related products on the product page."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivieren Sie die Option %1$s WooCommerce-Standardprodukte %2$s, um die "
"ausgewählten verwandten Produkte auf der Produktseite wiederzugeben."

#: admin/class-custom-related-products-admin.php:124
msgid "Custom related product settings:"
msgstr "Einstellungen für ähnliche Produkte:"

#: admin/class-custom-related-products-admin.php:124
msgid ""
"Related products for this item will be shown based on the selection made "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Ähnliche Produkte für diesen Artikel werden basierend auf der untenstehenden"
" Auswahl angezeigt."

